{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Past the Moon; Towards the Sun</strong> is a contemporary fantasy, kinetic visual novel\u00a0that invites you into a tale of self-discovery and empowerment. Step into the shoes of Colleen, a young woman filled with apprehension who has to overcome her self doubt to become the witch she was always meant to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/9ca06490e0c791f188131769661d5319.avif?t=1745685396\" width=615 height=73 /></span><strong>Story</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colleen\u2019s biggest worry was deciding on her future; torn between what her heart truly desired and what everyone told her she should do. But that all changed the night a stranger, cloaked in fur, dragged her into his life against her will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/53899df154176647ca86e93d7de0a7d8.poster.avif?t=1745685396\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/53899df154176647ca86e93d7de0a7d8.webm?t=1745685396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/53899df154176647ca86e93d7de0a7d8.mp4?t=1745685396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Colleen as her adventure takes her for unexpected twists and terns as she pushes through her self-doubt and discovers her own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features fully animated Live2D characters, along with limited voice acting to help bringing the story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/90f32413477346da5e3faf3654bae135.avif?t=1745685396\" width=600 height=663 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server to connect with fellow fans, participate in discussions, and receive exclusive updates straight from the developers.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3013160?t=1745685396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745685396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/13d8a1bdef7d5a68fad9fb99006f014d26ac049b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745685396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/13d8a1bdef7d5a68fad9fb99006f014d26ac049b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745685396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game includes scenes of violence, injury, a brief instance of non-explicit nudity and implied intimacy. The story explores themes of sacrifice and mortality. Some scenes include intense distress and implied torture."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3019100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Past the Moon; Towards the Sun</strong> is a contemporary fantasy, kinetic visual novel\u00a0that invites you into a tale of self-discovery and empowerment. Step into the shoes of Colleen, a young woman filled with apprehension who has to overcome her self doubt to become the witch she was always meant to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/9ca06490e0c791f188131769661d5319.avif?t=1745685396\" width=615 height=73 /></span><strong>Story</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colleen\u2019s biggest worry was deciding on her future; torn between what her heart truly desired and what everyone told her she should do. But that all changed the night a stranger, cloaked in fur, dragged her into his life against her will. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/53899df154176647ca86e93d7de0a7d8.poster.avif?t=1745685396\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/53899df154176647ca86e93d7de0a7d8.webm?t=1745685396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/53899df154176647ca86e93d7de0a7d8.mp4?t=1745685396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Colleen as her adventure takes her for unexpected twists and terns as she pushes through her self-doubt and discovers her own strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features fully animated Live2D characters, along with limited voice acting to help bringing the story to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013160/extras/90f32413477346da5e3faf3654bae135.avif?t=1745685396\" width=600 height=663 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server to connect with fellow fans, participate in discussions, and receive exclusive updates straight from the developers.</p>","developers":["Lunautuma"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie